        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 5.2m x 1.88m\nwith laminate wood flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 5.26m x 3.56m\nwith laminate wood flooring, solid fuel inset stove and french doors to the kitchen / dining room.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 3.78m x 5.44m\nwith fully fitted kitchen units, laminate wood flooring and sliding patio doors to the rear decking area and garden.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 2.41m x 3.38m\nwith hot press and folding attic stairs.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.76m x 3.33m\nwith fitted wardrobes and en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.42m x 2.1m\nwith wc, wash hand basin and corner shower unit.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.14m x 3.12m\nwith fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.12m x 2.3m\nwith fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.06m x 2.1m\nwith wc, wash hand basin, bath with shower and ceramic tiling.\n\n"
